        <tbody id="timeBody"></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="tbl-note" style="color:#7FA0C4">Durations assume timely payments, timely approval of drawings and material selections, and normal weather. Finishing trades overlap the structural programme from the ground floor slab onward, which is why the two figures are sequential on paper but partly concurrent on site.</p>
